			"AbsenceReportsComplianceMenu": "Compliance officers read every absence report (ExcuseRequest grants compliance-officers), but the People group that holds AbsenceReportsMenu does not reach them. menu-layout.json relocates this entry into GroupCompliance. Only compliance-officer: the admin reaches the page under People, and hr has no read on ExcuseRequest."
		}
